# Binary Placeholder - zabbix_agentd (Linux/macOS)
# 
# This placeholder indicates where the Zabbix Agent v1 executable should be placed.
# 
# Source: Zabbix official distribution
# Download from: https://www.zabbix.com/download_agents
# File: zabbix_agentd (Linux/macOS, 64-bit)
# Typical size: ~3-5 MB
#
# Installation instructions:
# 1. Download the Zabbix agent for your platform (Linux or macOS)
# 2. Extract zabbix_agentd from the archive
# 3. Place it in this directory: lin/bin/
# 4. Make it executable: chmod +x lin/bin/zabbix_agentd
# 5. This file will be automatically excluded from git (see .gitignore)
